# ---------- Battle Padel: deploy repo ----------
# This repo is PUBLIC (it serves GitHub Pages), so nothing with a secret in
# it may ever be committed here.

# The relay's runtime state. Holds the VAPID *private* key that signs push
# notifications, plus room history and player names. The server writes it
# next to itself unless DATA_FILE points elsewhere — so on a real host, set
# DATA_FILE to a path outside the checkout.
relay-data.json
relay/relay-data.json
**/relay-data.json

# secrets / env
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# noise
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
